  "description": "FacturX-CSharp is an open-source C# library for reading, creating and processing ZUGFeRD / Factur-X / XRechnung electronic invoices.\n\nZUGFeRD and Factur-X are European e-invoicing standards that embed structured XML data inside a PDF/A file.\nXRechnung is the German public-sector e-invoicing standard, also supported by this library.\n\nFind the project here:\nhttps://github.com/hervecadroy/FacturX-csharp",
